        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8463, Rustic Wrought Steel Rectangular Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Cylinder Wrought Steel Rectangular Deadbolt has a beautiful yet rustic look that makes it an exceptional piece of door security hardware for traditional homes. This Wrought Steel #3 Style Deadbolt is available in flat black steel and satin steel finishes. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. This front door lock is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. It features a Schlage C Keyway, so it can be keyed alike to match your existing hardware. Or better yet, choose a classic <a href=\"/collections/emtek-leversets\">Emtek Leverset</a> from the Wrought Steel Collection to give your door a whole new look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Wrought Steel #3 Style Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Wrought steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular #3 Wrought Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Wrought Steel Rectangular Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Wrought Steel Rectangular Deadbolt has a beautiful yet rustic look that makes it an exceptional piece of door security hardware for traditional homes. This Wrought Steel #3 Style Deadbolt is available in flat black steel and satin steel finishes. Choose from either a single cylinder deadbolt or a double cylinder deadbolt. This front door lock is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. It features a Schlage C Keyway, so it can be keyed alike to match your existing hardware.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Single Cylinder Wrought Steel Rectangular Deadbolts, Single Cylinder  Rectangular Wrought Steel Deadbolts, Emtek 8463, Emtek 8362, EMT-8463, Rectangular #3 Wrought Steel Deadbolts, single cylinder deadbolts, Rustic Wrought Steel Rectangular Deadbolts,"
